{"id":"n78671-1-8","stage":4,"title":"질의 · 质疑","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n78671-1-8-1","ko":"지금부터 질의 응답 시간을 갖도록 하겠습니다.","zh":"接下来我们就进入问答环节吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지금부터","meaning":"现在，当前，眼下","explanation":"지금：现在，当前，眼下；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"2","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지금부터","audio":"/audio/d989126e798118698e8e.mp3"}},{"text":"질의","meaning":"质疑，提问","explanation":"질의：质疑，提问","readings":[{"term":"질의","audio":"/audio/3c18f4df59ae0708f7bc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78671","senseId":"1","lemma":"질의","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"질의","audio":"/audio/3c18f4df59ae0708f7bc.mp3"}},{"text":"응답","meaning":"应答，回答","explanation":"응답：应答，回答","readings":[{"term":"응답","audio":"/audio/3042803f7f907772893a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71965","senseId":"1","lemma":"응답","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응답","audio":"/audio/3042803f7f907772893a.mp3"}},{"text":"시간을","meaning":"时间","explanation":"시간：时间；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"4","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시간을","audio":"/audio/ef64a5c202c601ff5d8d.mp3"}},{"text":"갖도록","meaning":"开，举办，举行","explanation":"갖다：开，举办，举行；도록：表示目的、达到的程度或促使某事发生。","readings":[{"term":"갖다","audio":"/audio/48e4cf165dc4c1c6d001.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29738","senseId":"9","lemma":"갖다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갖도록","audio":"/audio/b34d5b5bf81f38f48e9e.mp3"}},{"text":"하겠습니다.","meaning":"表示做前面的动作或希望成为该状态。","explanation":"하다：表示做前面的动作或希望成为该状态。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"7","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하겠습니다","audio":"/audio/0d628558fbb2496a4a4d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在，当前，眼下","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62522","definition":"不是过去也不是未来，而是当今。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"3c18f4df59ae0708","term":"질의","zh":"质疑，提问","audio":"/audio/3c18f4df59ae0708f7bc.mp3","entryId":"78671","definition":"询问感到怀疑或不懂的问题。","pronunciation":["지릐","지리"]},{"id":"3042803f7f907772","term":"응답","zh":"应答，回答","audio":"/audio/3042803f7f907772893a.mp3","entryId":"71965","definition":"回答呼叫或提问。","pronunciation":["응ː답"]},{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"时间","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62841","definition":"某件事从开始到结束的间隔期间。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"48e4cf165dc4c1c6","term":"갖다","zh":"开，举办，举行","audio":"/audio/48e4cf165dc4c1c6d001.mp3","entryId":"29738","definition":"召开会议或聚会，进行演出等。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示做前面的动作或希望成为该状态。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"表示做前面的动作或希望成为该状态。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/42c1464b9461f18e053f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n78671-1-8-2","ko":"그럼 제가 한 말씀 여쭤 봐도 되겠습니까?","zh":"那么，我可以问您一个问题吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"제가","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제가","audio":"/audio/c1f551b0d681d02645e2.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"一","explanation":"한：一","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"1","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"말씀","meaning":"话","explanation":"말씀：话","readings":[{"term":"말씀","audio":"/audio/9fa325aa12d3fdd01819.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27365","senseId":"2","lemma":"말씀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말씀","audio":"/audio/9fa325aa12d3fdd01819.mp3"}},{"text":"여쭤","meaning":"问询，问","explanation":"여쭈다：问询，问；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"여쭈다","audio":"/audio/cacf24da657d7fe6e24e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66573","senseId":"1","lemma":"여쭈다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여쭤","audio":"/audio/63271c7e60643a7fddab.mp3"}},{"text":"봐도","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐도","audio":"/audio/fdd01bd86a193dbd13e5.mp3"}},{"text":"되겠습니까?","meaning":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","explanation":"되다：可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；습니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되겠습니까","audio":"/audio/e0b9fca99cb033905b82.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"一个的。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"9fa325aa12d3fdd0","term":"말씀","zh":"话","audio":"/audio/9fa325aa12d3fdd01819.mp3","entryId":"27365","definition":"(谦词)自己的言语。","pronunciation":["말ː씀"]},{"id":"cacf24da657d7fe6","term":"여쭈다","zh":"问询，问","audio":"/audio/cacf24da657d7fe6e24e.mp3","entryId":"66573","definition":"向年长者告知。","pronunciation":["여ː쭈다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/27058d4ea804f7f7b3ae.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.129,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=78671","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":149,"sequenceScore":2.9557,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那么，我可以问您一个问题吗？","接下来我们就进入问答环节吧。","您还是新人，人气却这么高啊。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["接下来我们就进入问答环节吧。","您还是新人，人气却这么高啊。","那么，我可以问您一个问题吗？"],"answer":2}]}
